MILLION COLOR!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:25.850
<i>The solution chosen by the Militia soldiers...</i>

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.060
<i>...was to fly the Willgem over to the vicinity of Dianna's Palace.</i>

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.440
<i>However, this situation has resulted in even greater chaos.</i>

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>And yet I cannot allow a man like Agrippa Maintainer to have control over the moon.</i>

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.040
<i>And this is why I've decided to confront the enemies standing before me.</i>

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:54.090
<b>Turn X Activated</b>

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.220
Would you care for any?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.140
No, I'll pass.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.650
Right there is fine.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.530
Here.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.240
You should realize that as long as there are two ladies here, I've no desire to attempt fighting you.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.320
- Head over by the Sofa.
- Understood.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.330
Now, take a seat.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.840
It's the fragrance of Mondo Blume.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.260
Is that a product from this territory?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.760
Then, I'll enjoy giving this brand a try?

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.850
Yes.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.860
Jeez, this is such a waste of time!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.860
Those Earthlings will just find a way to outsmart us at this rate.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.650
Here's your dessert.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.160
That took long enough...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.160
Hey, I put in the effort to get San Michelle's special for you, you know?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.040
I'm aware of that!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.540
Ensign, move it straight and plug it in there nice and slowly now!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.540
Go ahead...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.040
Great!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.550
Even up here on the moon, I still think the Militia's corn beef tastes great.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.930
You bet it does!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:24.430
Do you really have things likes cows and sheep here?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.640
That's right.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.140
Thanks!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.230
I'm glad to be here.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.230
You're a liar.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.650
I'm serious!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.650
You say that...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.860
...but if you were sitting here with my sister or Queen Dianna, I bet you'd be twice as happy, right?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:06.430
Alrighty! You'd better hand over the White Mustache...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.350
...or do you no longer care about those 3 comrades of yours anymore?

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.350
Colonel Michael... What should we do?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.650
Will we be handing over the White Doll?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.940
You're going to stay right there.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.360
Try not to let them control the game's pacing.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.030
Just play along, Loran.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.440
Colonel Michael!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.740
Moonrace Mechanical Doll Troops...

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:32.040
If we, the Militia, have to surrender our great guardian, White Doll...

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:36.040
We'd rather allow ourselves to be destroyed here along with the Moon Palace.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.920
What? Are you going to give me the chance to satisfy my DNA instead?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:48.430
Genganam is the capital of moon. We wouldn't mind laying down our lives in a place like this!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:52.930
Please stop this! Why can't you just turn over the White Doll instead of allowing something like that to happen!?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.440
We plan to attack the street-bridge ahead of you.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.440
Please tell me you're joking!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.020
I ordered you to stay in place!

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.030
He's clueless. Didn't they ever teach that kid how to follow a bluff?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:07.240
Is this plan something you came up with after our meal?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.830
Fran, can you broadcast it over that comm?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.830
I won't be able to reach anyone outside of this ship.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.330
Are Yanni and his men prepared for the next battle?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.330
Yes!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.040
This bluff's success depends entirely on our Mechanical Dolls' abilities.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.340
Jacop, Bruno!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.460
Yes?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.840
Some big bluff isn't going to fool Ghingnham's Team.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.550
That may be true, and yet...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.630
The Colonel's determined to make things work somehow.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.140
I couldn't possibly give them such orders from here, you know?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.220
The Militia is often credited with blind valor.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:37.060
But, It's a shame that you will all need to be executed.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.150
My life is extremely important.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:44.940
Therefor, you must ask Agrippa and Ghingnham to order their forces to back off.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.650
It's a worthwhile loss to insure our use of the Earth, is it not?

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:53.160
If you fire that shot, you would also bring about the doom of this palace and the entire city.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:58.040
It will result in the rekindling of the instinct to battle, even within the Moonrace.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.540
When that happens, the Moon's civilization will be destroyed.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.130
And it would be due to my sins...

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:08.050
The earth girl knows more than she should...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.230
Do you honestly think those people are capable of destroying the city of Genganam?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.350
All the same, I'd like you to have the Mahiroo Team withdraw.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.360
Then what should we do about Turn A?

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.730
We can't simply let it do as it wishes.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.440
They may or may not be bluffing...

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:30.450
But the Mahiroo Team's actions may provoke the Terrans into going all out!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:35.240
No worries. Genganam's a city my ancestors helped to create.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.160
If I allowed even a single pillar to fall, I'd never be able to face the ancestors who...

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.040
That's why the Mahiroo Troops...

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.330
What in the...?

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.460
Sutero?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.920
Fight your hardest and die honorably, like all my opponents should!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.760
Please stop this!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:59.140
Wasn't the Ghingnham Team meant to be a private army that preps to defend us by practicing maneuvers in orbit?

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:03.150
Don't compare me with that fool Gym, who's only done useless training for two to three thousand years!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.330
As you can see, Sutero does have some uses.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:18.830
He's attempting to capture the enemy without using his Beam Weapons.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.460
What reason could require you to have me recall him?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.840
Lord Agrippa, don't you want to obtain the Turn A?

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:28.760
You know better than anyone that it won't be that simple!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.260
What if in the process of trying to capture it, the Mahiroo team awakens the "Butterfly"?

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.050
The Butterfly?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.720
But, the data from the Turn X still hasn't been fully analyzed yet.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.560
Make sure those Mahiroo pilots understand how potentially dangerous this situation could be!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.230
I don't need you to remind me.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.030
Get me the Mountain Cycle, I need to speak with Merrybell.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.860
Are you going to use the Turn X?

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.030
It's the best item that we have to deal with him.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.240
Use one poison against another, you say?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.240
Then I wish you the best.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.860
I see.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.240
I'll be down there shortly, but this situation is urgent.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.540
Will you be able to do it?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.620
Well, the Bandit and the Turn X both seem to work well.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.540
I'll let you handle things.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.550
You can't use beams weapons!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.340
We're still right in front of the White Palace!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.260
Let go of me!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.840
The White Mustache is right there!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:01.220
How can I pull back when the enemy is standing directly before me!?

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.730
So we're 100 meters below the moon's surface?

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.030
That's correct. This should lead us directly to the White Palace.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.040
How can there be a forest below the ground!?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.250
That Damned Ghingnham...

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.250
I can't believe he'd allow the Mahiroo team to battle in front of the White Palace...

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.750
We're already at Dianna's palace?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:35.050
Correct. However, you mustn't forget that it's currently the territory of our enemy Agrippa.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.130
The enemy's stronghold?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.430
Loran, are you serious?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.260
I intend to hand over White Doll.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.220
You idiot!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:45.140
I can't allow my home city to end up like Nocis did!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.230
Fine then...

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.860
If you're no longer capable of it... I will take on the White Doll.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:55.030
Milady, you could get yourself hurt! As of now, I'm the better pilot for it...

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.450
Milady...

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:03.450
Why don't you understand that we can't possibly let our enemy have the White Doll!?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.460
- Pilot of Turn A!
- What?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.330
Your Highness, Agrippa Maintainer!?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.630
Correct, pilot of Turn A.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:20.640
Terrans, or rather crew of Guin Sard Rhineford's spacecraft...

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.640
Shall we see how your "Turn A" will fare in a match against our "Turn X"?

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.220
Turn X?

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.850
But this battle will be on the surface!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.560
What?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.650
They want us to fight with "Turn X"?

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.860
Must be some new model Mechanical Doll...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.860
How can there be a "Turn X", when an X is the same no matter which way you flip it!?

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.950
What does this "Turn" mean!?

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.240
I don't understand all of this "Turn A" or "Turn X" talk...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.830
What was that!?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:48.540
Don't you even have any idea what the Turn A you're piloting is!?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.460
That displays a great level of ignorance, Sir Terran...

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.460
The moon's canals and underground cities... They're gifts granted to us by mankind's progress!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:01.260
These things cannot be endangered any further by pointless Mobile Suit battles!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.760
What makes you think you need to tell me that?

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.720
- Sister!?
- Queen Dianna!?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.060
If you will not agree to battle the Turn X on the lunar surface...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.650
I cannot guarantee you the lives of these three people.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.520
I still don't even know what this Turn X is.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:19.150
If you agree to battle with the Turn X, then your three comrades will be freed.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:25.160
Of course, If this palace still exists at that point, I will willingly hand it back to Lady Dianna.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.460
The pilot of the White Doll will be... myself.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.890
- You may lower your weapon, Midgard.
- Sir!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.310
I overheard you mention something about the "Turn X"...

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.230
Is that supposed to be the strongest Mechanical Doll in the Ghingnham forces?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.820
You might say something like that...

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.900
You don't seem terribly fond of this line of questioning, yet I have one thing I must ask.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.700
Go ahead, Ma'am.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.620
Tell me why you sent assassins after Queen Dianna.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.620
She represents a threat to the moon's peace.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.000
Along with anyone who thinks on the same lines.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.500
My master told me you prolonged the war on earth and intentionally caused Dianna a number of problems.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.090
What are you talking about?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.720
After they began the Operation to Return to Earth...

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:29.720
The combat instincts of the formerly peaceful Moonrace members began to reawaken.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.520
In short, they reverted back to the people of ancient times.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.020
Their combat instincts were awakened?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.310
Since the plan began...

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:39.690
War has followed anywhere that Her Majesty Dianna has gone.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.610
Now she's brought the same destructive war back to the moon.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.030
She always tried to avoid resorting to combat!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.200
And by doing so, it ended up having the opposite effect!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:51.200
It appears that the Queen's reawakening only brought her misfortune!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.330
Misfortune?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.000
If it had not been for this regrettable misfortune...

00:12:55.000 --> 00:13:00.210
Then that woman wouldn't have led the Terrans here, and such conflicts never would've been instigated!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.090
Is he even capable of listening to his Commander's orders?

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.010
Stop him with the Mega Particle Cannons!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.220
Keep it between 5 percent to 10 percent of its full power.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.230
Right. Tweaking particle output...

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.810
Let's hope it doesn't reach the city.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.020
Firing two cannons.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.990
Oh my... they seriously fired a shot?

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.290
That city's even larger and more crowded than Nocis? Will we end up ruining it?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:43.210
If he's going to drag this conflict to the space port, that'll give us an edge as well!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.720
I am only following the order that Agrippa gave to me! Open up the hatch!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.310
Why you! Agrippa said...

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.730
What?

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.610
It should still be daytime...

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.610
Is he afraid of the blackout?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.200
How in the...!?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.500
We've rerouted all of the power from Genganam.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.000
The Turn X still hasn't started to move yet.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.630
More, then. Give another jolt of the city's entire output.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.800
Give him every drop of power the Moonrace can generate!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.300
If I were to do that, it might damage the hospitals and the life support capsules!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.930
It's too much of a risk! I can't do it!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.310
Who do you think you're speaking too? Do it!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.310
The activation of the Turn X has been approved by Agrippa Maintainer as well!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.520
Sir!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.610
So it's taking this much effort to awaken it?

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:50.200
I wonder how much power you're concealing in there, Turn X?

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.490
Are power failures infrequent?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.700
Genganam has never had one.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:57.200
However, we're almost there anyhow.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.290
We can make it the rest of the way on our own power, if need be.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.630
Right.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.420
The lights have returned... I wonder what happened?

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.930
I've never seen such a thing. It's not good...

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.200
Gym Ghingnham, The Turn X is moving!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.910
Will we be able to use it?

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.500
It really is quite a marvelous mechanical doll...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.630
Gym, I bet you'll be able to handle this thing!

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.130
I've been researching it ever since we uncovered it! Just leave it to me.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.710
What's happening now!?

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.800
First we have a blackout... and now a groundquake?

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.220
Is that relic on the wall moving!?

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.800
What is it, Sir Guin!?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.010
Get down, you two! Everyone else as well...

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.390
Kaysan, look out!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.190
What is the Gold Type doing here?

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.400
It's Lieutenant Harry Ord!?

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.900
Kihel, you finally made it here.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.830
Harry Ord was with Queen Dianna Soriel?

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.620
Damn you Harry...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.210
It took you long enough to bring back the Queen...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:29.000
Stop that, Midgard! I am Dianna!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.920
Are you blind, Midgard!?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.720
I'm the true Dianna!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.930
W..What!?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.720
Two Diannas?

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:41.220
Sir Agrippa, the Queen has finally returned here!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:44.230
You will now transfer sovereign authority to the rightful Queen!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:49.320
I'll return the real Queen's sovereign authority, but which of these two is she?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.820
In spite of all you've done, you still act ignorant of your actions and continue to blame Queen Dianna.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.990
I understand your true intent.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.910
You intend to expel any Moonrace that have shown your "combat instincts" from the moon, don't you?

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.910
And what's the matter with that?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.620
If you have the will to fight, go to Earth.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.790
The Moonrace has no need for such feelings towards fighting.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:13.300
Then why did you give authority to a man as militaristic as Gym?

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.800
I didn't grant him such power.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:22.020
In order to understand your Turn A, I allowed him to conduct his research on the Turn X.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.730
And just what IS this Turn X!?

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.890
It's something like the Turn A.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:31.400
What is known is that it was the Turn A that destroyed earth's ancient civilization.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.610
Turn A destroyed the earth's civilization?

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.030
The ancient technological space era...

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.700
...was destroyed by the White Doll!?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:44.200
Up til now, the Turn A has been piloted by a young man named Loran.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.710
He has displayed absolutely no trace of these fighting instincts of yours!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:51.500
No one had any idea what the Turn A was when it was first uncovered!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:56.720
However, once Turn X was excavated from the Lunar Mountain Cycle, we knew the truth.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.300
The delays in Dianna's terrestrial immigration began to show a pattern...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.220
Which told us that Turn A had been uncovered!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.100
If Turn A is left alone...

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:09.600
It's possible that both the Earth and the Moon's civilizations will again be destroyed!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.730
You can't escape!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.530
Harry, don't bother chasing him.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.400
I'm more concerned for the Winter Palace.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.200
The Winter Palace?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.910
The blackout just now and all this talk of excavations from the Lunar Mountain Cycle aren't the real issue.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.700
I've more reason to be concerned about the Winter Palace.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.910
You said the "Winter Palace"?

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.000
Yes.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.710
It's the life support for the majority of the Moonrace.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:36.710
Before recent events, managing that palace's daily operations was Agrippa's true job.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.220
Right...

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.800
Harry, let's get moving!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.930
A "High Heel"?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.010
Leave this one to me!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.730
Let's go, then!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.890
Miss Kihel, Lady Lily!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:11.210
Are you alright? That was quite a bit of sudden running!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.920
- We've still a ways to go, right?
- I'm alright.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.920
Won't there be any cars coming through here?

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.920
That could work.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:22.010
You should try to call our chamberlain Keiston, or Lady Misumasu.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.930
You'll find a phone over there.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.220
That's right!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:28.390
Keiston and Misumasu, you say?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.100
Things have grown more tense, and you've been given more to worry about...

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:38.320
While I was asleep for much of it, this body of mine has still been alive for hundreds of years.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.110
Therefore, I can't be quite as energetic as you, Miss Kihel.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.910
I...

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.700
...wanted to return to earth and live out the rest of my life, up til my death.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.920
Aging gradually, and eventually dying like any normal person would.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:59.210
I wanted to allow at least a few members of the Moonrace to share that experience with me.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.220
Was it simply my selfish ego talking?

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:04.300
Not at all. It's not your ego.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:10.230
I wished for peace... but that other curse I know so well, war, only came in its place.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:13.600
Perhaps the time for my life to end has now come.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.020
What are you saying!?

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:20.320
What of the many people like Lieutenant Harry who are trying to protect your life? Don't you feel sorry for them?

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:25.320
Miss Kihel, the person that the Lieutenant loves is you... but thank you.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.330
I'm terribly sorry...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.500
What?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.220
Is this Turn X really calling out to me, just like they said it would?

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:53.100
Could the White Doll truly be an evil Mechanical Doll?

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:58.400
That's what we're going to verify, by inspecting the truths of the Dark History that are archived in the Winter Palace.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.190
Are there any books there that list the events in the Dark History?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.610
The ancient history is all preserved there in the data.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:35.890
What!?

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:49.620
Is that... Turn X!?

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.120
It's in good condition!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:03.000
Well Turn A... I, Gym Ghingnham, will be the one that readies you for your grave!

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b><i>Yama no ha tsuki wa michi</i></b>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b>As the full moon, casts itself over the mountain's edge...</b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b><i>iki zuku anata no mori</i></b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b>...it spreads the breath of life spreads into the forest where you stand...</b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b><i>Natsu kusa abite nemuru</i></b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>As you sleep in the summer grass...</b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b><i>Itooshii yokogao</i></b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b>...your profile is a lovely sight to behold.</b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b><i>Kaze ni</i></b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>The wind...</b>

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.780
<b><i>LaLaLu... LaLaLu...</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b><i>utae... hane ni</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b>The sight of your wings, is seen...</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b><i>tsuki utsushi</i></b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b>...in the moon's reflection.</b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b><i>Inochi kagaya kase yo</i></b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b>This wonderful life will shine vividly.</b>

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:42.940
<i>As the brothers, Turn A and Turn X, begin to resonate...</i>

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:46.650
<i>...The data from the Dark history is opened once more.</i>

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:51.450
<i>Queen Dianna was searching for the records from the past ages of space exploration.</i>

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:54.160
<i>There, it is said that humanity's old civilizations on the earth...</i>

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.620
<i>...were buried by something called the Moonlight Butterfly.</i>

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...<i>
The Shocking Dark History</i>

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:05.250
"The wind recalls forgotten memories."

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:08.460
<b>The Shocking Dark History</b>
